librabbitmq (0.14.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * [b9be669] New upstream version 0.12.0
  * [28c033a] New upstream version 0.13.0
  * [d1854f7] New upstream version 0.14.0 (Closes: #1031226)
    - Add option to read username/password from file in tools addressing
      CVE-2023-35789, thanks to Christian Kastner <ckk@debian.org> for
      bugreport and patch pointer (Closes: #1037322)
  * [b56b3ca] d/copyright: update for new upstream releases
  * [5808cb4] d/patches/: drop patches integrated upstream and refresh
    remaining
  * [dd987f3] d/librabbitmq4.symbols: add new symbols introduced in 0.12.0 and
    0.14.0
  * [9d71db8] d/librabbitmq-dev.install: also install new upstream headers
    location
  * [a5d9cf3] use upstream's build system to build the tools manpages.
    Among other things this also provides librabbitmq-tools(7).
    (Closes: #855880)
  * [d0a18fe] d/control: Standards-Version: 4.7.0 (no changes required)
  * [2511702] new maintainer, cf. #1031226 for the previous maintainers'
    approval.
    Thanks to Michael Fladischer <michael@fladi.at>, Brian May
    <bam@debian.org> for all their work
  * [648c907] d/salsa-ci.yml: added
  * [778a872] d/watch: make it work with current GitHub
  * [83cf14d] d/rules: configure with CMAKE_BUILD_RPATH_USE_ORIGIN for
    reproducibility

